{"id": "clm:74337b2f46813ef560b612b31b0c766af4da0047d36fd4ed34972526ff8c2e03", "type": "statement", "text": "Beaam's Atlas guide identifies an operational risk for solo projects: urgent Atlas emails share an inbox with billing notices and can be overlooked. This is the monitoring vendor's qualitative assessment, not a measured billing-alert failure rate. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-08-23)", "source_url": "https://beaam.app/guides/monitor-mongodb-atlas/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas billing alert notification delivery"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:bea2d38699bd3319c012d6b675ce204bdcb15ebe49462a6d2baf02a550cab178", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:406b7fb4497d92d42096ca1f40552147e2ba7ce463fdd46c250b39cca4ccc33f"]}
{"id": "clm:486fd1dba4915e5cb2745b930998f74edce6a495dabe876ebb60746fd3c25077", "type": "statement", "text": "Inference: treat billing-alert delivery as a warning mechanism rather than evidence of an enforced spending cap. MongoDB describes notifying a designated person after a billing limit is exceeded; a historical community proposal adds separate webhook-triggered automation to pause or terminate a cluster. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-31)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas billing alert notification delivery"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.reddit.com/r/mongodb/comments/p0otmv/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:bea2d38699bd3319c012d6b675ce204bdcb15ebe49462a6d2baf02a550cab178", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:31bc28d80b4b2bbf3f0a17ded7ee01fecb0f650ce0ba0196b7c1db1740bf65a7", "ev:8ddb3bb51ff13a510a312536ffc2812aaa1964edd093adb83186afb9913ec206"]}
{"id": "clm:c5b5812f1000cb5d2223421a1bf6ff575eedccaff00524ecb5340dcccac9f239", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas supports billing alerts at organization and project scope; the monthly 'current bill for any single project' and organization-total conditions are organization alerts. A project's daily billed-amount threshold is available at project scope. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/reference/alert-conditions.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas billing alert notification delivery"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/integrate-msft-teams.md", "https://feedback.mongodb.com/ideas/CUSTOMER-I-9985"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:bea2d38699bd3319c012d6b675ce204bdcb15ebe49462a6d2baf02a550cab178", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:252f20e592c409af3f1841d9e63c02f03167504613ba7f12ecb769138eabdc9f", "ev:75bf6a7495eccef19e292b85261d32e996d4a8994fc9f14fb83c13f88b93511c"]}
{"id": "clm:d290b75612831bafb110860cbea1912104bb8a3278fb6c87f946684e2ad575cc", "type": "statement", "text": "For billing email routing, leaving Billing Email Address blank sends billing alerts to Organization Owners and Billing Admins. Specifying an address adds it to those recipients unless 'Only send invoice emails to the Billing Email Address' is checked, which restricts delivery to that address. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas billing alert notification delivery"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:bea2d38699bd3319c012d6b675ce204bdcb15ebe49462a6d2baf02a550cab178", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6b18f0fcc61ffcab155e4fd5e44623285891067cbf30cd660d762317ccaf6864"]}
{"id": "clm:e1c61dc6c7c2b0d8828ae8e8f693edecbde5aecb56b1b7e6a7c9084f0ec8405e", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas says processing and network conditions can delay notification delivery. The 'send if condition lasts at least' and 'resend after' controls apply only to Host alerts, not billing or other event-based alerts. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/alerts.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas billing alert notification delivery"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:bea2d38699bd3319c012d6b675ce204bdcb15ebe49462a6d2baf02a550cab178", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:98e11d08392e6f3155ad1ba854efe10c3411d0e94017b9e72d8f59b34fff6cd4"]}
{"id": "clm:e00c0d18a06cea6f477a331c59e2183836e04828b32fdb199f3d9e372a16bb9f", "type": "statement", "text": "Atlas alert settings select both triggering conditions and notification methods. OneUptime's setup walkthrough includes Billing as a target and choosing notification channels; configuring a threshold therefore also requires deliberate recipient and channel selection. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-03-31)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/configure-alerts.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas billing alert notification delivery"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-03-31-mongodb-atlas-alerts-notifications/view"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:bea2d38699bd3319c012d6b675ce204bdcb15ebe49462a6d2baf02a550cab178", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0bc8132b7f82165288ecdb9d4264d895f454e28c22c27ebfaedbea55d047f451", "ev:36e94e8c23f04209419c257707e038b765b3a5b3a731673a7ba493f0a35ccf45"]}
{"id": "clm:b324cf1b04a9b110a0eee2b14426f23b9403c78547d2d276bcaf67083a9c69ee", "type": "statement", "text": "Organization Owners manage organization alerts; Organization Billing Admins have limited authorization to manage billing alerts. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/configure-alerts.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas billing alert notification delivery"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/integrate-msft-teams.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:bea2d38699bd3319c012d6b675ce204bdcb15ebe49462a6d2baf02a550cab178", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:61c639b039f6d611a1805689f34b2fdb4c962584fb2efa8b85d5aa4690cdb13c"]}
{"id": "clm:e0192c032b6edffc64b57844ceaa296e814755088e328159390ebc0a689be618", "type": "statement", "text": "For webhook delivery, Atlas sends HTTP POST requests. Troubleshooting includes checking Internet reachability, firewall rules, a 2xx response, an enabled alert with webhook selected, and delivery errors in the Activity Feed. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/webhook-integration.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas billing alert notification delivery"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:bea2d38699bd3319c012d6b675ce204bdcb15ebe49462a6d2baf02a550cab178", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:187b7f653b25b5dac2a1caf8b9fdd2af67367c72e3691353aa30530abfa4f67c", "ev:9e3c7b7735ae0459c70ec35aea204c01856af3a33f7d15d6649535998ffac267"]}
{"id": "clm:efd2fd369f39c7a88bdeab3d404e1611cefd03d073b40a03b0ce3ca39d22a334", "type": "statement", "text": "The documented organization Microsoft Teams workflow includes Billing targets and a 'Post Test Alert' button after entering the incoming webhook URL. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/tutorial/integrate-msft-teams.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Atlas billing alert notification delivery"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:bea2d38699bd3319c012d6b675ce204bdcb15ebe49462a6d2baf02a550cab178", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:b4123c91328ff23f9580e0c1e6079ad2c1b91fb84791e478cdf6e77cd26c8ef6"]}
